<</nobr>>

:: Day1_SQ_HouseTour [day1 sidequest house tutorial]
<<nobr>>
<<centerImage "image/location/home.png">>

<p>My room is the last honest space in this house. Everything in here is mine and none of it is curated. A twin bed with sheets that haven't been changed in longer than I'd admit. A desk with my laptop and a tower of energy drink cans I keep meaning to recycle. Posters on the wall: a band, a game, a movie. Laundry on the floor because the hamper is three feet away and three feet might as well be three miles.</p>

<p>My closet has: six t-shirts, three pairs of jeans, two pairs of shorts, one hoodie, one flannel shirt, sneakers, flip-flops, and a blazer from a wedding two years ago that doesn't fit anymore. The most feminine thing in here is a chapstick that might be tinted.</p>

<p>This room will change. Slowly at first. But not today. Today it's still mine. Today it's still a boy's room.</p>

<p>Evelyn's room is down the hall. The door's open. Her vanity dominates the far wall, perfume bottles, cosmetics, a walk-in closet visible but not really explored yet. A pair of black stockings folded on the dresser. A silk robe draped over a chair. Earrings in a porcelain dish: pearl studs, gold hoops, diamond drops.</p>

<p>Lily's door is shut, per usual, bass thumping faintly from behind it. Through the gap under the door I can just make out the glow of a ring light left on. Whatever she's building in there, she's building it deliberately.</p>

<<set $houseTourSeen to true>>
<<spendTime 1>>
<<set $currentMapLocation to "home">>

